  "details": "Sometimes when switching out avatars the camera gets stuck in such a way in Desktop mode that the camera gets stuck in a weird position inside the character model that appears outside of the head of the Avatar or stuck inside of the Avatar model in such a way where you end up seeing the inside of the avatars model because the camera is not matching the avatars model height. Other times where it gets so bad the camera completely glitches out of the Avatar body completely and loses the avatars body its suppose to be connected to completely, anchoring your camera view to the centre of the world map you're in, and behaving in such a way that makes it feel like your noclipping through the entire map from a fixed point.\nWe need an avatar camera reset option to fix these broken camera states in Desktop mode.",
